    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477603\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Mission of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477604\" id=\"p1\">raise up unto thee a <span class=\"key-word\">Prophet</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Deut. 18:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477605\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"key-word\">government</span> shall be upon his shoulder, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Isa. 9:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477606\" id=\"p3\">He will swallow up <span class=\"key-word\">death</span> in victory, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Isa. 25:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477607\" id=\"p4\">with my dead body shall they <span class=\"key-word\">arise</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Isa. 26:19</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477608\" id=\"p5\">he was <span class=\"key-word\">wounded</span> for our transgressions, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/53?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Isa. 53:5</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Mosiah 14:5</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477609\" id=\"p6\">Lord hath anointed me to <span class=\"key-word\">preach</span> good tidings, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/61?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Isa. 61:1</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Luke 4:18</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Mosiah 12:21</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477610\" id=\"p7\">he shall <span class=\"key-word\">save</span> his people from their sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Matt. 1:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477611\" id=\"p8\">to fulfil all <span class=\"key-word\">righteousness</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Matt. 3:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477612\" id=\"p9\">to <span class=\"key-word\">save</span> that which was lost, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Matt. 18:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477613\" id=\"p10\">I may <span class=\"key-word\">preach</span> there also: for therefore came I, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p38#p38\">Mark 1:38</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477614\" id=\"p11\">shall <span class=\"key-word\">reign</span> over the house of Jacob, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">Luke 1:33</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477615\" id=\"p12\">sent me to <span class=\"key-word\">heal</span> the brokenhearted, to preach, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Luke 4:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477616\" id=\"p13\">All things were <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> by him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">John 1:3</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">1:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p16-p18#p16\">Col. 1:16–18</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477617\" id=\"p14\">not to do mine own <span class=\"key-word\">will</span>, but the will of him that sent me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p38#p38\">John 6:38</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">3 Ne. 27:13</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477618\" id=\"p15\">Son of man should be <span class=\"key-word\">glorified</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">John 12:23</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">3 Ne. 11:11</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477619\" id=\"p16\">glorify thy Son, that thy Son also may <span class=\"key-word\">glorify</span> thee, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">John 17:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477620\" id=\"p17\">in Christ shall all be made <span class=\"key-word\">alive</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">1 Cor. 15:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477621\" id=\"p18\">author of eternal <span class=\"key-word\">salvation</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Heb. 5:9</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mosiah 3:9</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477622\" id=\"p19\"><span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> of the new testament, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Heb. 9:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477623\" id=\"p20\">make <span class=\"key-word\">intercession</span> for all, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">2 Ne. 2:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477624\" id=\"p21\">suffereth himself to … <span class=\"key-word\">die</span> for all men, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Ne. 9:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477625\" id=\"p22\">reconciled unto him through the <span class=\"key-word\">atonement</span> of Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Jacob 4:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477626\" id=\"p23\"><span class=\"key-word\">salvation</span> … through faith on his name, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mosiah 3:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477627\" id=\"p24\"><span class=\"key-word\">publisheth</span> peace; that bringeth good tidings, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Mosiah 12:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477628\" id=\"p25\">shall <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> his people, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Mosiah 15:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477629\" id=\"p26\"><span class=\"key-word\">satisfied</span> the demands of justice, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mosiah 15:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477630\" id=\"p27\"><span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> … through the … death of Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Mosiah 18:2</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">3 Ne. 9:17</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477631\" id=\"p28\">Christ … <span class=\"key-word\">redeem</span> his people from their sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Alma 5:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477632\" id=\"p29\">sufferings and death of Christ <span class=\"key-word\">atone</span> for their sins, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Alma 22:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477633\" id=\"p30\">God himself atoneth for the sins of the world, to bring about the plan of <span class=\"key-word\">mercy</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/42?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Alma 42:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477634\" id=\"p31\">by me <span class=\"key-word\">redemption</span> cometh, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">3 Ne. 9:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477635\" id=\"p32\">taking upon me the <span class=\"key-word\">sins</span> of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">3 Ne. 11:11</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477636\" id=\"p33\">I have come to <span class=\"key-word\">fulfil</span> the law, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">3 Ne. 15:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477637\" id=\"p34\">In me shall all mankind have <span class=\"key-word\">life</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Ether 3:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477638\" id=\"p35\">that I might <span class=\"key-word\">subdue</span> all things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">D&amp;C 19:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477639\" id=\"p36\">The light and the <span class=\"key-word\">Redeemer</span> of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">D&amp;C 93:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477640\" id=\"p37\">Savior spent about three years in his <span class=\"key-word\">ministry</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">D&amp;C 138:25</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477641\" id=\"p38\">to bring to pass the <span class=\"key-word\">immortality</span> and eternal life of man, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p39#p39\">Moses 1:39</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477642\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/zech/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Zech. 13:6</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p52#p52\">D&amp;C 45:52</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Abr. 3:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
